  "title": "175‑lb bear ate a plane‑dropped cocaine stash",
  "description": "In 1985 a drug‑smuggling plane dumped dozens of cocaine packages over the Appalachian wilderness. A lone black bear found the stash, ate enough to overdose, and became an unlikely legend. This short explains how a sky‑high drug run ended with a bear’s fatal binge and its strange afterlife in a Kentucky mall.\n\nKey points:\n- September 11, 1985: cocaine drop from a Cessna over Tennessee.\n- December 23, 1985: bear discovered dead, stomach full of cocaine.\n- The taxidermied bear now tours a Kentucky mall.\n\nBased on the Wikipedia article \"Cocaine Bear (bear)\" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cocaine_Bear_(bear)), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.\n\nImages from Wikimedia Commons:\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall (cropped).jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall_(cropped).jpg\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall.jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall.jpg\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall (cropped).jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall_(cropped).jpg\nUSCGC Bear transfers cocaine in the Atlantic near Florida, Sept 2014.jpg (U.S. Department of Defense Current Photos, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USCGC_Bear_transfers_cocaine_in_the_Atlantic_near_Florida,_Sept_2014.jpg\nCocaine Bear, Kentucky for Kentucky Fun Mall (cropped).jpg (Ferrett333, CC BY-SA 4.0): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cocaine_Bear,_Kentucky_for_Kentucky_Fun_Mall_(cropped).jpg\nCGC Bear Cocaine Offload 110921-G-ZE884-024.jpg (Petty Officer 2nd Class Nick Ameen, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CGC_Bear_Cocaine_Offload_110921-G-ZE884-024.jpg\nCGC BEAR DVIDS1082493.jpg (Petty Officer 2nd Class Kip Wadlow, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CGC_BEAR_DVIDS1082493.jpg\nCGC BEAR DVIDS1082494.jpg (Petty Officer 2nd Class Kip Wadlow, Public domain): https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CGC_BEAR_DVIDS1082494.jpg",
